## الأمر المختصر النهائي

```text
Build a full Arabic RTL multi-tenant SaaS system for UTC children's strengths assessment program.

Each organization has its own username/password and private dashboard. Organization users enter children data, track 40 stories per child, enter assessment results using interactive strength cards, select strength 1, strength 2, and strength 3, and the system automatically assigns the child to the group of strength 1 only. Strength 2 and strength 3 are saved for reports and analytics only.

UTC Super Admin has a central dashboard to monitor all organizations, completion progress, delayed organizations, notifications, training attendance, exercises, and reports.

The system includes:
authentication, roles, organizations, children, stories, assessment results, strengths, groups, third-force training sessions, attendance, exercises, exercise schedules, notifications, reports, PDF/Excel export, activity logs, and dashboards.

Use Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Auth.js, Arabic RTL UI, UTC brand colors, responsive SaaS layout, and strict multi-tenant data isolation.
```
